# Environment configuration template
#
# The current static frontend and exploratory notebooks do not require
# credentials or environment variables by default.
#
# If a future authorized integration needs configuration, add documented
# variable names here with empty or obviously fake values only.
# Never add real API keys, retailer cookies, passwords, browser sessions,
# access tokens, or personal information to this file.
#
# Example future placeholders (uncomment only when implemented):
# APP_ENV=development
# REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=15
#
# Keep the real local file named .env. It is ignored by Git.
